<div class="encadre">
    <span class="etiquette">Key point</span>
    <p>
        A neume = a drawing read from left to right and from bottom to top. Its
        <strong>shape</strong> tells the movement of the voice&nbsp;; a few added signs
        (episema, quilisma) tell the <strong>manner</strong>. You now have all the basic
        vocabulary needed to tackle the book that brings them together.
    </p>
</div>

